        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-20, Decorative Tip Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSimple yet beautiful, the 3 Inch Button Tip Cabinet Door Pull made by RK International is a great example of the elegance of traditional styles. This door pull has a timelessness as well as being able to transcend many of the characteristic limitations of old and new that are placed on home decor these days. With the right finish (and there are 7 to choose from) this decorative rod pull will look great in almost any setting.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-20 Decorative Rod Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Grip Diameter: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/nrp.jpg?v=1704442257\" width=\"599\" height=\"127\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
